 at a meeting?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n		<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-faq__answer\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-faq__answer has-muted-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\">Meetings usually open with a reading, followed by members sharing their experience on a topic or a Step. They typically last about an hour. In-person meetings are held around the GTA; online meetings run on Zoom. Newcomers are always welcome.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-panel -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion -->', 'Questions & answers', 'Answers from people who\'ve been exactly where you are. Don\'t see your question? Get in touch.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '58-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-09-06 15:31:49', '2026-09-06 19:31:49', '', 58, 'http://localhost:8888/matoronto/?p=61', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(62, 0, '2026-09-06 15:48:46', '2026-09-06 19:48:46', '<!-- wp:accordion {\"autoclose\":true,\"headingLevel\":3,\"className\":\"ma-faq\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion ma-faq\" role=\"group\">\n	<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"openByDefault\":true} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item is-open\">\n		<!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n		<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading has-icon has-icon-right\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What is Marijuana Anonymous?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n		<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\" role=\"region\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-faq__answer\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-faq__answer has-muted-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\">MA is a fellowship of people who share their experience, strength, and hope with each other so they may solve their common problem and help others recover from marijuana addiction. We use the same Twelve Steps of recovery founded by Alcoholics Anonymous.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-panel -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n	<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n		<!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n		<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading has-icon has-icon-right\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How much does it cost?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n		<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\" role=\"region\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-faq__answer\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-faq__answer has-muted-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\">Nothing. There are no dues or fees for membership. MA is entirely self-supporting through voluntary contributions from members — the 7th Tradition.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-panel -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n	<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n		<!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n		<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading has-icon has-icon-right\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Do I have to speak or share personal details?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n		<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\" role=\"region\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-faq__answer\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-faq__answer has-muted-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\">No. You can come to a meeting and simply listen for as long as you like. Many people attend several meetings before sharing anything. Only your first name is ever needed — anonymity is a core principle.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-panel -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n	<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n		<!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n		<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading has-icon has-icon-right\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How do I know if I am a marijuana addict?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n		<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\" role=\"region\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-faq__answer\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-faq__answer has-muted-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\">Only you can decide. Many members found it helpful to read The Twelve Questions — an honest self-inventory about how marijuana affects your life. If marijuana is causing problems and you cannot seem to stop, MA may be for you.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-panel -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n	<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n		<!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n		<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading has-icon has-icon-right\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Is MA religious?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n		<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\" role=\"region\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-faq__answer\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-faq__answer has-muted-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\">No. MA is not affiliated with any religious or secular organization. The program refers to a higher power of your own understanding — that can be anything, including the group itself. Members hold every belief and none.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-panel -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n	<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n		<!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n		<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading has-icon has-icon-right\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What happens at a meeting?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n		<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\" role=\"region\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-faq__answer\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-faq__answer has-muted-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\">Meetings usually open with a reading, followed by members sharing their experience on a topic or a Step. They typically last about an hour. In-person meetings are held around the GTA; online meetings run on Zoom. Newcomers are always welcome.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:accordion-panel -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion -->', 'Questions & answers', 'Answers from people who\'ve been exactly where you are. Don\'t see your question? Get in touch.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '58-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-09-06 15:48:46', '2026-09-06 19:48:46', '', 58, 'http://localhost:8888/matoronto/?p=62', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(63, 0, '2026-09-06 15:54:25', '2026-09-06 19:54:25', '<!-- wp:group {\"templateLock\":\"contentOnly\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"ma-lit\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"26px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"columnCount\":3}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull ma-lit\">\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card\">\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__cover\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card__cover\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__kind\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__kind\">Book</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__cover-title\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__cover-title\">Life with Hope</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__body\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card__body\">\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__title\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading ma-lit-card__title has-large-font-size\"><a href=\"#\">Life with Hope</a></h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__desc\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__desc has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">The basic text of Marijuana Anonymous — the 12 Steps and 12 Traditions as they apply to marijuana addiction, with members&#039; experience throughout.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-arrow-link ma-lit-card__cta\",\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"is-style-arrow-link ma-lit-card__cta has-x-small-font-size\">Read online <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card\">\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__cover\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card__cover\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__kind\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__kind\">Daily reader</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__cover-title\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__cover-title\">A New Leaf</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__body\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card__body\">\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__title\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading ma-lit-card__title has-large-font-size\"><a href=\"#\">A New Leaf</a></h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__desc\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__desc has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">A page for every day of the year — short reflections and meditations to carry recovery into daily life.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-arrow-link ma-lit-card__cta\",\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"is-style-arrow-link ma-lit-card__cta has-x-small-font-size\">Learn more <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card\">\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__cover\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card__cover\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__kind\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__kind\">Pamphlet</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__cover-title\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__cover-title\">Detoxing from Marijuana</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__body\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card__body\">\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__title\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading ma-lit-card__title has-large-font-size\"><a href=\"#\">Detoxing from Marijuana</a></h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__desc\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__desc has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">What to expect physically and emotionally in early abstinence, and how the fellowship helps you through it.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-arrow-link ma-lit-card__cta\",\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"is-style-arrow-link ma-lit-card__cta has-x-small-font-size\">Read online <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card\">\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__cover\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card__cover\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__kind\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__kind\">Pamphlet</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__cover-title\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__cover-title\">The Twelve Questions</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__body\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card__body\">\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__title\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading ma-lit-card__title has-large-font-size\"><a href=\"#\">The Twelve Questions</a></h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__desc\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__desc has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Twelve honest questions to help you decide for yourself whether MA is for you.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-arrow-link ma-lit-card__cta\",\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"is-style-arrow-link ma-lit-card__cta has-x-small-font-size\">Read online <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card\">\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__cover\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card__cover\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__kind\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__kind\">Pamphlet</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__cover-title\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__cover-title\">For the Newcomer</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__body\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card__body\">\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__title\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading ma-lit-card__title has-large-font-size\"><a href=\"#\">For the Newcomer</a></h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__desc\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__desc has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">A gentle introduction to your first meetings — what happens, what to expect, and why you are welcome.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-arrow-link ma-lit-card__cta\",\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"is-style-arrow-link ma-lit-card__cta has-x-small-font-size\">Read online <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card\">\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__cover\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card__cover\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__kind\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__kind\">Booklet</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__cover-title\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__cover-title\">Twelve Steps Workbook</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__body\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group ma-lit-card__body\">\n			<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__title\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n			<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading ma-lit-card__title has-large-font-size\"><a href=\"#\">Twelve Steps Workbook</a></h3>\n			<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ma-lit-card__desc\",\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n			<p class=\"ma-lit-card__desc has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Guided questions for working each of the Twelve Steps, on your own or with a sponsor.</p>\n			<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n			<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"i